{"id":"u-1f6c3ebf-c422-4789-aaa5-424c8f634cfa","src":"community","title":"BULK UP Upper Lower","author":"Adam G.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/LmzUD7-bulk-up-upper-lower","desc":"This program can work for everyone.\nBeginner should train a bit lighter though.\n\nRPE - don't take it too seriously, just train intensely. The last week (10th) is a deload week - RPE goes down to 6 (beginners may even go down to RPE 5)\n\nIf RPE is 9-10 then it means do sets at RPE 9 and the last one to failure (RPE 10).\n\nAvoid going to the gym 3 times in a row and don't do 3 rest days in a row. A proper schedule looks something like this:\n\nDay 1: Upper Body 1\nDay 2: Lower Body 1\nDay 3: Rest Day\nDay 4: Upper Body 2\nDay 5: Lower Body 2\nDay 6 & 7: Rest Day\n\nBest of luck on this workout program!","level":["Intermediate","Advanced","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Bodyweight Fitness","Athletics","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":7,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-08T17:27:07.754Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Body 1","Lower Body 1","Upper Body 2","Lower Body 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"